  "DataFinderHoverMsg": "Target period for which there is data for the process selected at the Start point (or the first process) is displayed in light blue. You can check when the data is collected from each unit: yearly [Year] ⇔ monthly [Month] ⇔ (daily [Week]). Please input the target range by using the information. The first click specifies the starting point (From), and the second click specifies the ending point (To). Press [Set] to enter the last selected date and time into the target period.",
